<title>INDIA: Indian interbank term money quotes - May 12.</title>
<headline>Indian interbank term money quotes - May 12.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are indicative quotes (in percent) for interbank term money on May 12:</p>
<p>.</p>
<p> TERM		 Private	  State-run    Foreign</p>
<p>			banks	    banks	  banks</p>
<p> ---------------  ---------    -----------   ----------</p>
<p>    7  DAYS	 ----/-----    ---------    ----------</p>
