<p>    1 YEAR	  ----------   -----------   11.00-13.00</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>The indicative interbank term money quotes are based on contributions from the Centurion Bank, UTI Bank, Indusind Bank, Global Trust Bank, Andhra Bank, Bank of Nova Scotia, Citi Bank N.A., Deutsche Bank, Bank of America, ABN Amro Bank N.V., Standard Chartered Bank, American Express Bank, Bank of America, HDFC Bank, Bank of India. For more details contact Bombay money desk on (022) 265 9000</p>
